@startuml PreviewPanda - Diagrama de secuencia (Quality)

title PreviewPanda — Secuencia del workflow "Terraform Quality"

actor Desarrollador as Dev
participant "GitHub\n(Pull Request)" as PR
participant "GitHub Actions" as GA
participant "Terraform CLI" as TF
participant "TFLint" as Lint
participant "Checkov" as Checkov

Dev -> PR : abre / push
PR -> GA : dispara ci.yml

GA -> GA : checkout del repo
GA -> TF : instalar Terraform
GA -> TF : fmt -check -recursive
TF --> GA : ok / diff encontrado

GA -> TF : init -reconfigure -backend=false
note right
  Sin backend: no hace falta
  login a AWS para este job
end note
TF --> GA : providers descargados

GA -> TF : validate
TF --> GA : configuracion valida / error

GA -> Lint : instalar TFLint
GA -> Lint : tflint --init
GA -> Lint : tflint
Lint --> GA : hallazgos (si los hay)

GA -> Checkov : escanear infra/\n(soft_fail = true)
Checkov --> GA : resultado del escaneo\n(no bloquea el PR)

GA -> PR : check "Terraform Quality"\n(success / failure)

@enduml
